WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.378 --> 00:00:04.588
Hi, this is Mike.

00:00:04.588 --> 00:00:06.673
I was just calling to see if
that job that you offered was

00:00:06.673 --> 00:00:07.424
still available.

00:00:07.424 --> 00:00:09.801
Yes, the security guard.

00:00:09.801 --> 00:00:10.969
I will take anything.

00:00:12.137 --> 00:00:15.515
This place was huge in
the 80's with the kids.

00:00:15.515 --> 00:00:17.309
They shut it down years ago.

00:00:17.309 --> 00:00:20.771
The owner's just not
ready to let it go yet.

00:00:20.771 --> 00:00:22.522
I will work, and
you will sleep.

00:00:22.522 --> 00:00:23.523
I understand.

00:00:25.859 --> 00:00:26.860
Gimme your hand.

00:00:35.744 --> 00:00:42.167
All you have to do is keep
your eyes on the monitor.

00:00:42.167 --> 00:00:43.752
Welcome to Freddy Fazbear's!

00:00:43.752 --> 00:00:46.088
Where fantasy and
fun come to life!

00:00:46.088 --> 00:00:47.839
Okay.

00:00:53.387 --> 00:00:56.056
You must be,
new security guard.

00:00:56.056 --> 00:00:57.849
Can I, uh, help you, officer?

00:00:57.849 --> 00:01:01.270
Have you met them yet?

00:01:01.270 --> 00:01:03.105
Met who?

00:01:03.105 --> 00:01:04.564
Them.

00:01:23.250 --> 00:01:26.837
In the 80's,
kids went missing.

00:01:26.837 --> 00:01:29.881
The police searched
Freddy's top to bottom.

00:01:29.881 --> 00:01:32.175
Hello?

00:01:32.175 --> 00:01:33.552
They never found them.

00:01:35.345 --> 00:01:37.681
It's why the place shut down.

00:01:38.640 --> 00:01:40.892
There are ghost children
possessing giant robots?

00:01:42.144 --> 00:01:43.228
Thanks for the heads up.

00:01:44.521 --> 00:01:46.398
Technically, they're
animatronics.

00:01:48.191 --> 00:01:49.484
What do they want?

00:01:49.484 --> 00:01:51.820
They want to make
her, like them.

00:01:51.820 --> 00:01:52.821
Abby!

00:01:53.947 --> 00:01:55.032
Tell me how to stop them!

00:01:55.032 --> 00:01:55.907
[ giggling ]

00:01:55.907 --> 00:01:56.658
[ scream ]

00:01:57.200 --> 00:01:58.201
It's too late.

00:02:01.163 --> 00:02:02.414
Mike!
-Abby go!

00:02:10.005 --> 00:02:12.341
[ scream ]

00:02:17.346 --> 00:02:19.181
Where to?

00:02:20.140 --> 00:02:21.975
Why do I always
get the weirdos?

